OL,3,GNEWSAGaming skills made the focus of
OL,4,Adriving campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FSkills gained through playing computer
OL,7,Fgames could help young men become
OL,8,Fbetter drivers if harnessed correctly,
OL,9,Fthe deputy mayor of West Yorkshire has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FBaroness Alison Lowe, who is in charge
OL,13,Fof policing and crime for the region,
OL,14,Fhas launched a new "lock in" campaign
OL,15,Fas part of this year's Road Safety
OL,16,FWeek.
OL,18,FAlmost 90% of those aged 16 to 24 play
OL,19,Fcomputer games, she said, with scanning
OL,20,Ffor hazards, checking left and right
OL,21,Fand staying focused essential for
OL,22,Fgaming success.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
